language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"This story takes place in a fictional town, in a fictional country, in a fictional world. One morning, a young lady awakens to find that she has lost all her memories prior to that morning. Her life, her relationships, her very name—all gone. All that's left is a cell phone with numbers and names she doesn't recognize and Orion, a young boy that only she appears to be able to see. With Orion's guidance, she struggles to make sense of herself, a boyfriend she doesn't know and the thousand and one little things that make up a daily life. But with no memories left, the only alternative is to forge new ones, even if that means leaving old loves behind.\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Male Harem","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Alternate Universe","rank":80,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Work","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Yandere","rank":71,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Isekai","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fairy","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Josei","rank":60,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"AMNESIA","english":"AMNESIA","native":"AMNESIA","romaji":"AMNESIA","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"失忆症"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"アムネシア"}]},"trailer":{"id":"cJOPc9sxUFI","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cJOPc9sxUFI/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}